{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1004_null", "source_sha256": "022651408c68c435dc9f7be59c19a9d85306165147240720a70ef1e8f371c140", "ja": "サッ！　タタタタ……", "zh": "嗖！哒哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1005_p", "source_sha256": "09566a61ac240154354a5f34be643d36a8e1bd1594c0846f4d7b181d2cd58218", "ja": "ん？　今逃げていったのは……猫？", "zh": "嗯？刚才跑掉的是……猫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "49985d3a84274637dcc492a0e237171ebe924014bf0d6bef72fc101aa16c5398", "ja": "あ、はい。あのネコちゃん、よくここにいる子で、\n私の師匠なんです。えへへ♪", "zh": "啊，是的。那只小猫经常待在这里，是我的师父。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1007_p", "source_sha256": "288637c6003a123bf137f46ffd4e4cc719f670f4fc4023503432aa9cee19337d", "ja": "師匠……？\nそれって、どういう……？", "zh": "师父……？\n这是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "fb47fdd2334d96eaf644e208b60c3fd6bdb64c821fa84e50cb0be9ab3db672ac", "ja": "ほら、この間、ネコちゃんになりきってライブ\nしたじゃないですか？　あの時のレッスンで……。", "zh": "您看，前些天不是有过一次全情投入地扮演小猫咪的演出吗？就是在那次的训练中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "dbbdea454a44bd1a0ef03eed9e77b56d0e96fae8c2c12d99aaece703e0cd0f81", "ja": "ネコの仕草とか表情とか、勉強したいなーって、\n思ってたら、あの子が教えてくれたんです！", "zh": "我当时想着要学习猫咪的动作和表情什么的，结果那孩子就教给我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1010_p", "source_sha256": "465a582d099c6a214f91a81028735877cf60a5fc297187c68652ed6b1411cec8", "ja": "ふむ……つまり、あの猫を参考にした、と？", "zh": "嗯……也就是说，你是参考了那只猫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "c0be77e75ffb5c1efc23d3f697fda42106fb657580078c3c1e7d0018ef6d198b", "ja": "はい！　あの子の仕草、本当にかわいいんです！\n顔を洗ったり、頬をスリスリしてきたり……♪", "zh": "是的！那孩子的动作真的特别可爱！\n又是洗脸，又是蹭我的脸颊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "ea8db7ea6cf3fab23a5033dee55d114f01f4339ef37658087ebe1ca2c94b1788", "ja": "何より、ちょっと大きめなのがポイント高くて！\nぷにっとしてて、最高なんですよね～！", "zh": "最重要的是，稍微大一点这一点特别加分！\n软乎乎的，简直棒极了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "e867ad1aab70a0b990495277704507a566ca413a87269e403a6fa8341d8df689", "ja": "ステージでのパフォーマンスは、全部\n師匠の直伝だったんですよ。えへへ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "舞台上的表演，全都是师父亲传的哦。嘿嘿，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ca97d1e5a2f0a566529b1e18f751066a2c1a2f5c1038ecdecfb57adfaba9d415", "ja": "バッチリ決まってたよ。お客さんの評判もよかったし。\nポーズはセクシーなのに、表情は可愛くて。", "zh": "完美发挥出来了。客人们的评价也很好。\n动作明明很性感，表情却很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "bbdcbc3d4c2ac8e4e2ab0e576080f11b7f655c523b159f8683f4f4aa44c930ad", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？　そこを一番意識したんです！\n師匠をいっぱい観察した甲斐がありました！", "zh": "哇，真的吗？我最注重的就是这一点了！\n多亏了我认真观察师父呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7155d04536776926e5b327baae8b086972062a17e3b5f074c4ada601458c75fa", "ja": "師匠に感謝しなきゃな。今度紹介してくれるか？\n一言お礼を言っておきたいんだ。", "zh": "得好好感谢师父呢。下次能介绍给我认识吗？\n我想当面向它道个谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0253_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "ba8faccb08ffa447b0ecaccf53fa5bea9b89abd824015d23749731f63d6a0204", "ja": "あははっ、わかりました！　じゃあ今度紹介しますね。\nにゃくそく……じゃなくて、約束です！", "zh": "啊哈哈，好的！那我下次介绍给您认识。\n拉勾……不对，说好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
